  INF MsGraphicsPkg/OnScreenKeyboardDxe/OnScreenKeyboardDxe.inf
  INF MsGraphicsPkg/MsUiTheme/Dxe/MsUiThemeProtocol.inf
  INF MsGraphicsPkg/DisplayEngineDxe/DisplayEngineDxe.inf
